    { "Value of 0.0f can improve temporal stability of bright pixels\nLower values are more stable with ghosting\nHigher values are more pixelly, but less ghosting", "0.0f 的值可以提升明亮像素的时域稳定性\n较低的值在重影方面更稳定\n较高的值更像素化，但重影更少" },
    { "Reactive Scale", "反应性缩放" },
