    { "Increasing this scales FSR3.1 computed shading\nchange value at read to have higher reactiveness.", "提高此值会放大 FSR3.1 在读取时计算出的着色\n变化值，从而获得更高的反应性。" },
    { "Acc. Added Per Frame", "每帧累加量" },
    { "Corresponds to amount of accumulation added per frame\nat pixel coordinate where disocclusion occured or when\nreactive mask value is > 0.0f. Decreasing this and \ndrawing the ghosting object (IE no mv) to reactive mask \nwith value close to 1.0f can decrease temporal ghosting.\nDecreasing this could result in more thin feature pixels flickering.", "对应每帧添加的累积量\n在发生去遮挡的像素坐标处，或当\n反应掩码值 > 0.0f 时。减小此值并将 \n产生重影的物体（即无运动矢量）绘制到反应掩码 \n且值接近 1.0f，可以减少时域重影。\n减小此值可能导致更多细小特征像素闪烁。" },
    { "Min. Disocclusion Acc.", "最小去遮挡累积" },
    { "Increasing this value may reduce white pixel temporal\nflickering around swaying thin objects that are disoccluding \none another often. Too high value may increase ghosting.", "提高此值可以减少摆动的细小物体\n相互频繁去遮挡时周围白色像素的时域 \n闪烁。过高的值可能会增加重影。" },
