    { "Sharpness", "锐化" },
    { "Override", "覆盖" },
    { "Ignores the value sent by the game\nand uses the value set below", "忽略游戏发送的数值\n并使用下方设置的数值" },
    { "(Current sharpness: %.3f)", "（当前锐化值：%.3f）" },
    { "(Current sharpness: disabled)", "（当前锐化：已禁用）" },
    { "Enable RCAS/DA", "启用 RCAS/DA" },
    { "Enable OptiScaler's sharpening filter\nBy default uses a sharpening value provided by the game\nSelect 'Override' under 'Sharpness' and adjust the slider\nto change it\n\nSome upscalers have their own sharpness filter, so this\noption is not always needed", "启用 OptiScaler 的锐化滤镜\n默认使用游戏提供的锐化数值\n在“锐化”下选择“覆盖”并调整滑块\n即可更改\n\n部分超分器自带锐化滤镜，因此\n并非总是需要此选项" },
    { "RCAS", "RCAS" },
    { "Use AMD's RCAS\nModified to add Contrast parameter\nand MAS support", "使用 AMD 的 RCAS\n已修改以加入对比度参数\n和 MAS 支持" },
    { "Depth Aware (RCAS)", "深度感知（RCAS）" },
    { "Use Depth Aware Sharpening (RCAS)\nSmarter sharpening with less artifacts,\nbut also heavier\n\nThe farther away is the object, the more\nsharpening is applied", "使用深度感知锐化（RCAS）\n更智能的锐化，伪影更少，\n但开销也更大\n\n物体距离越远，\n应用的锐化越多" },
    { "Depth Aware (DAS)", "深度感知（DAS）" },
    { "Use Depth Aware Sharpening (DAS)\nDepth-aware directional adaptive luma sharpener\nSmarter sharpening with less artifacts,\nbut also heavier\n\nThe farther away is the object, the more\nsharpening is applied", "使用深度感知锐化（DAS）\n深度感知方向自适应亮度锐化器\n更智能的锐化，伪影更少，\n但开销也更大\n\n物体距离越远，\n应用的锐化越多" },
    { "Enable Motion Adaptive Sharpness", "启用运动自适应锐化" },
    { "Enables sharpness adjustments according to the motion", "根据运动情况调整锐化程度" },
    { "DA + MAS Debug", "DA + MAS 调试" },
    { "Enable DA + MAS debug views\nBlue tint for DA detected edges\n\nMore red areas will have more sharpness applied\nGreen areas will get reduced sharpness", "启用 DA + MAS 调试视图\n检测到的 DA 边缘显示为蓝色\n\n越红的区域会应用越多的锐化\n绿色区域将减少锐化" },
    { "Advanced DA Parameters", "高级 DA 参数" },
    { "Clamp Output", "钳制输出" },
    { "Clamps the final image to the [0, 1] range.\n\nPrevents overshoot artifacts such as bright halos or negative colors.\nRecommended for LDR pipelines; optional for HDR depending on tone-mapping.\n\nWhen not set OptiScaler controls it via upscalers HDR flag", "将最终图像钳制在 [0, 1] 范围内。\n\n可防止过冲伪影，例如过亮的光晕或负色。\n推荐用于 LDR 管线；对 HDR 而言视色调映射而定，为可选项。\n\n未设置时，OptiScaler 会通过超分器的 HDR 标志来控制" },
    { "Depth Bias", "深度偏移" },
    { "Ignores small depth differences before edge detection.\n\nHigher values reduce flickering and noise from minor depth changes, but may soften real geometry edges.\nLower values preserve fine detail but can cause unstable or noisy edge detection.", "在边缘检测前忽略微小的深度差异。\n\n较高的数值可减少由细微深度变化引起的闪烁和噪点，但可能使真实几何边缘变软。\n较低的数值可保留细节，但可能导致边缘检测不稳定或出现噪点。" },
    { "Depth Scale", "深度缩放" },
    { "Controls how strongly sharpening is reduced across depth edges.\n\nHigher values more aggressively prevent sharpening across object boundaries (reduces halos).\nLower values allow more sharpening to pass across edges (sharper but riskier).", "控制跨深度边缘时锐化被削弱的强度。\n\n较高的数值会更积极地阻止锐化跨越物体边界（减少光晕）。\n较低的数值允许更多锐化穿过边缘（更锐利但风险更高）。" },
    { "Reset Depth Values", "重置深度数值" },
    { "Contrast Enabled", "启用对比度" },
    { "Controls sharpness at high contrast areas.", "控制高对比区域的锐化程度。" },
    { "Contrast", "对比度" },
    { "Positive values decrease sharpness at high contrast areas.\nNegative values increase sharpness at high contrast areas.", "正值会降低高对比区域的锐化。\n负值会提高高对比区域的锐化。" },
    { "Motion Adaptive Sharpness", "运动自适应锐化" },
    { "MAS Debug", "MAS 调试" },
    { "Areas that are more red will have more sharpness applied\nGreen areas will get reduced sharpness", "越红的区域会应用越多的锐化\n绿色区域将减少锐化" },
    { "MotionSharpness", "MotionSharpness" },
    { "Maximum amount of sharpness that motion can add or remove.\n\nNegative values reduce sharpening in motion (recommended).\nPositive values increase sharpening in motion.\n\nThe final adjustment scales with motion and is capped at this value.", "运动可增加或减少的最大锐化量。\n\n负值会在运动时减少锐化（推荐）。\n正值会在运动时增加锐化。\n\n最终调整随运动量缩放，并以此数值为上限。" },
    { "MotionThreshod", "MotionThreshod" },
    { "Minimum motion required before motion-based sharpening adjustment begins.\n\nHigher values ignore small movements (more stable).\nLower values react to subtle motion (more sensitive).", "开始进行基于运动的锐化调整所需的最小运动量。\n\n较高的数值会忽略小幅移动（更稳定）。\n较低的数值会对细微运动做出反应（更敏感）。" },
    { "MotionRange", "MotionRange" },
    { "Defines the motion range over which the effect ramps from zero to full strength.\n\nValues above the threshold are mapped into this range.\nLarger values make the response smoother and more gradual.\nSmaller values make the effect react more quickly and aggressively.", "定义效果从零逐渐增强到最大强度所对应的运动范围。\n\n高于阈值的数值会被映射到此范围内。\n较大的数值使响应更平滑、更渐进。\n较小的数值使效果反应更快、更激进。" },
    { "Upscale Ratio Override", "超分比例覆盖" },
    { "Override all", "覆盖全部" },
    { "Overrides every upscaler preset with the set value\n\n1.5x on a 1080p screen means an internal res of 720p\n1080 / 1.5 = 720", "用设定的数值覆盖所有超分预设\n\n在 1080p 屏幕上 1.5x 表示内部渲染分辨率为 720p\n1080 / 1.5 = 720" },
    { "Override per quality preset", "按质量预设分别覆盖" },
    { "Lets you override each preset's ratio individually\nNote that not every game supports every quality preset\n\n1.5x on a 1080p screen means internal resolution of 720p\n1080 / 1.5 = 720", "可让您单独覆盖每个预设的比例\n请注意并非每款游戏都支持所有质量预设\n\n在 1080p 屏幕上 1.5x 表示内部渲染分辨率为 720p\n1080 / 1.5 = 720" },
    { "All Ratios", "所有比例" },
    { "DLAA", "DLAA" },
