    { "Performance", "性能" },
    { "Ultra Performance", "超级性能" },
    { "Output Scaling", "输出缩放" },
    { "Enable", "启用" },
    { "Upscales the image internally to a higher output resolution\nthen downscales it back to your display resolution\n\nValues <1.0 make the upscaler cheaper\nValues >1.0 make image sharper at the cost of performance\n\nIf greyed out, please check Git Wiki - Unreal Engine tweaks\n\nTarget res and total ratio at the bottom (max. total 3.0!)", "在内部将图像超分到更高的输出分辨率\n然后再缩放回您的显示分辨率\n\n小于 1.0 的数值可降低超分开销\n大于 1.0 的数值可使图像更锐利，但会牺牲性能\n\n如果显示为灰色不可用，请查看 Git Wiki 的 Unreal Engine 调整说明\n\n目标分辨率与总比例显示在底部（总比例最大 3.0！）" },
    { "FSR1", "FSR1" },
    { "Default option.\nGood enough image quality and very fast.", "默认选项。\n画质足够好，而且速度非常快。" },
    { "Bicubic", "双三次插值" },
    { "Fastest traditional option.\nProduces a very soft/blurry image, but might be okay for downscaling.", "最快的传统选项。\n会产生非常柔和/模糊的画面，但用于降采样可能还可以。" },
    { "Catmull-Rom", "Catmull-Rom" },
    { "Designed primarily for downscaling.\nRetains good contrast with minimal artefacts, but softer than Lanczos.", "主要为降采样而设计。\n在伪影极少的同时保持良好的对比度，但比 Lanczos 更柔和。" },
    { "Lanczos2", "Lanczos2" },
    { "Lighter and faster than Lanczos3.\nLess prone to ringing artefacts, but slightly blurrier.", "比 Lanczos3 更轻量、更快。\n更不容易出现振铃伪影，但略微更模糊。" },
    { "Lanczos3", "Lanczos3" },
    { "Heavier version of Lanczos2.\nOffers the sharpest image, but is the most prone to ringing.\nConsidered the best along with Kaiser3.", "Lanczos2 的更重版本。\n可提供最锐利的画面，但最容易出现振铃。\n与 Kaiser3 一同被认为是最佳选择。" },
    { "Kaiser2", "Kaiser2" },
    { "Similar to Lanczos2.\nSmoother and less prone to artefacts than Lanczos, but slightly blurrier.", "与 Lanczos2 类似。\n比 Lanczos 更平滑、更不容易产生伪影，但略微更模糊。" },
    { "Kaiser3", "Kaiser3" },
    { "Similar to Lanczos3.\nFar less prone to artefacting than Lanczos3, but much heavier on the GPU.\nConsidered the best along with Lanczos3.", "与 Lanczos3 类似。\n远比 Lanczos3 不容易产生伪影，但对 GPU 的负担重得多。\n与 Lanczos3 一同被认为是最佳选择。" },
    { "MAGIC", "MAGIC" },
    { "Specialised to prevent artifacts.\nEliminates harsh halos for a natural look, but can appear slightly soft.", "专门用于防止伪影。\n消除明显的晕影以呈现自然观感，但可能显得略微柔和。" },
    { "Only FSR1 and Bicubic are supported when Ratio is below 1.0.", "当比例低于 1.0 时，仅支持 FSR1 和 Bicubic。" },
